  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figs 31 and 32, current-state (February 2022) and future-state supply chain systems in Rwanda. Current state: OpenHIM, a master health facility registry, national product catalogue and terminology services, DHIS2, QAT for forecasting, eLMIS for orders and inventory, SAGE for warehouse and procurement, EMR for dispensing. Future state: an ERP for supplier and contract, order, warehouse, inventory and procurement management, a new transportation system, QAT, EMR, a supplier registry, supply chain reports, a data warehouse, track and trace and product verification, with GPFVAN, manufacturers and BUFMAR among external systems.",
